{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1165344-contagion-chronicle-wants","id":1165344,"title":"Contagion Chronicle Wants?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-12-05T10:00:07-08:00","id":1165344,"title":"Contagion Chronicle Wants?","content":"Basically, what\u2019s in the title. What do you want to see in the Contagion Chronicle (Crossover Chronicle) that you aren\u2019t 100% sure will be there?<br /> <br /> Personally, my three things are<br /> 1. Support for crossover with subsplats, including ones from supplements. <br /> 2. Rules for regular non-hunter mortals in crossover games, and how to handle them.<br /> 3. Beyond protagonists and protagonists working together, and antagonists and antagonists workout together, I really want to see reasons antagonists and protaginists of different splats would work together, and what it would mean. As well as protagonist v protagonist fighting and antagonist v antagonist fighting, but that\u2019s pretty unsaid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13001,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13001-sdespencer","user":"SdeSpencer","date":".  Apparently I can\u2019t count oops 12-05-2017, 06:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13001-sdespencer","name":"SdeSpencer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-05T13:26:37-08:00","id":1165404,"title":"","content":"My primary wish is that the Contagion itself not be something blatant enough to force different supernatural societies to come together, but something <i>subtle</i> enough that only societies that have already come together tend to detect it.<br /> <br /> Secondary wish is crossover by faction as well as species. Ie, what deals would the Invictus make with the Guardians of the Veil or the Autumn Court, not just vampires with mages or changelings.<br /> <br /> Co-Secondary wish is a selection of true mixed societies and factions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-05T15:17:29-08:00","id":1165440,"title":"","content":"Agree with <b>SunlessNick</b>, except for the last part. Instead of distinct factions devoted to mixing things, I want to see how each faction deals with non-standard members, since I see very little necessity for most of them to be exclusive, and even the ones with reason to do so I can easily think about exceptions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-05T17:17:56-08:00","id":1165465,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SunlessNick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1165344-contagion-chronicle-wants?p=1165404#post1165404\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My primary wish is that the Contagion itself not be something blatant enough to force different supernatural societies to come together, but something <i>subtle</i> enough that only societies that have already come together tend to detect it.<br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>This, so much. It\u2019d help quell worries that the Contagion would be the metaplot for CofD. <br /> <br /> <br /> My true wish is that the Contagion not be some external crisis..... but a metaphor for different supernatural forces \u2018contaminating\u2019 and \u2018infecting\u2019 each other. Like that short mention of Strix presence corrupting Infrastructure. This too would remove concerns of a new metaplot rising, and be much more usable for individual games. I\u2019m not opposed to a literal magical Contagion running amok, but still.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":12619,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","user":"21C Hermit","date":".  Oops missed a \u2018not\u2019 there 12-05-2017, 08:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-05T17:26:50-08:00","id":1165466,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1165344-contagion-chronicle-wants?p=1165465#post1165465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This, so much. It\u2019d help quell worries that the Contagion would be the metaplot for CofD.<br /> <br /> <br /> My true wish is that the Contagion not be some external crisis..... but a metaphor for different supernatural forces \u2018contaminating\u2019 and \u2018infecting\u2019 each other. Like that short mention of Strix presence corrupting Infrastructure. This too would remove concerns of a new metaplot rising, and be much more usable for individual games. I\u2019m opposed to a literal magical Contagion running amok, but still.</div> </div> </div> </div><i>whispers to self about how cool that sounds</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13001-sdespencer","name":"SdeSpencer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-05T21:23:09-08:00","id":1165514,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1165344-contagion-chronicle-wants?p=1165465#post1165465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My true wish is that the Contagion not be some external crisis..... but a metaphor for different supernatural forces \u2018contaminating\u2019 and \u2018infecting\u2019 each other. Like that short mention of Strix presence corrupting Infrastructure.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ooh, that's interesting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-06T03:46:34-08:00","id":1165543,"title":"","content":"Other than wishing people would stop conflating a Chronicle with setting-wide metaplot, I hope there's a selection of crossover-inspired Merits that better enable groups to work together. New Werewolf Merits for including changelings into their hunting parties, or having a demon Totem or something.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-06T19:50:41-08:00","id":1165748,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BigDamnHero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1165344-contagion-chronicle-wants?p=1165543#post1165543\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Other than wishing people would stop conflating a Chronicle with setting-wide metaplot, I hope there's a selection of crossover-inspired Merits that better enable groups to work together. New Werewolf Merits for including changelings into their hunting parties, or <b>having a demon Totem</b> or something.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;<i>Dial Tone</i>: I'm sorry, but Totem you are trying to reach is temporarily unavailable. Please leave your message and they will get back to you at their earliest convenience.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-06T20:26:34-08:00","id":1165756,"title":"","content":"Note: In Changeling 2e, you can have courts which get their power from a pact with other splats, so that'd be a good way to show some crossover. You can even have a crossover court system, like courts of blood, moons, sigils, and codes. <br /> <br /> Blood's patron is ancient primordial vampire who is locked in torpor until the agreed upon date, with their bargain requiring the changelings to use oneiromancy to eternally protect the kindred from the horrific dreamscapes which normally plague a vampire, and in return the court gains protection against their own nightmares allowing them to ward areas from the gentry by spilling their own blood.<br /> <br /> Moon's patron is a mighty pack of hunter in darkness werewolves who claimed the local hedge as part of their territory, where as long as the changelings maintain the trods for their hunts the local spirits will keep their eyes open for huntsmen and gentry ironside. But if the pack was all killed, the court's power would fade from the world.<br /> <br /> Sigil's patron is a free council acanthus who tries to study all possible symbolism that can be found from ancient fairytales and folktales. By having the changelings recite their stories from the lands which warp time, the changelings find that they begin to see omens which hint at a gentry's approach. The patron takes special interest in changelings which were taken long ago and yet escaped in the modern day.<br /> <br /> Code's patron is a mysterious alien entity who has worn thousands of faces, speaks in riddles and code, and offers deals to courtiers who cross it's path. Because of it's history of making deals and it's odd mindset, some rumours claim the patron is one of the true fey. Members of the code court always seem to have an alibi and often seem oddly mundane for entities of wyrd. Every 4 months the Code court is sent a message from their patron, and it is the responsibility of the courtiers to have this message sent out until everyone in the Code Court knows it, but if the message is spoken by the King and Queens of any of the other courts suddenly the cover stories of the code court fade from people's memories.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-06T20:33:26-08:00","id":1165757,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1165344-contagion-chronicle-wants?p=1165756#post1165756\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Note: In Changeling 2e, you can have courts which get their power from a pact with other splats, so that'd be a good way to show some crossover. You can even have a crossover court system, like courts of blood, moons, sigils, and codes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Personally, I want to see the example court in Prague expanded. They have a bargain that has them gather Disquiet from the city's Prometheans, convert it into Glamour, and feed it to... something","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-06T22:08:04-08:00","id":1165770,"title":"","content":"I'd have to collect my thoughts on the matter, but for now it'll be nice to finally see some more juicy Mummy/Other Games interaction for 2nd edition rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-07T18:16:45-08:00","id":1165988,"title":"","content":"Honestly, Up until I realized that the Contagion Was the focus of the so called 'Crossover' Chronicle, I wasn't much interested, Since I quite enjoy threading similar themes and working out the small mechanical bugs that come with Crossover, so such a supplement would probably only be a 'cannibalize ideas' sort of thing for me. but with the different direction (A threat or something that is dealt with by several splats working together) seems to have a lot more original content for someone like me.<br /> <br /> As for things Im not sure the game will have but I want?<br /> 1.Crossover factions. A sort of psudosplat for the contagion chronicle specifically.. Thematically, perhaps Defined by how to deal with the Contagion?<br /> 2.The above to include some traditional antagonists, as well. I mean, Having angels or Huntsmen might be a tough sell, but the otherwise 'evil protagonist' Style enemies could probably fill in for their more playable counterparts, as far as fighting the contagion goes.<br /> 3. a place for hunters/mortals in this style of Chronicle. Perhaps a bit of a long shot, since the whole pitch seemed to be about the supernaturals, but what can I say, despite my username, Im a fan of Mortals.<br /> <br /> Im sure there is more I havent thought of, but those are the ones that come to my mind immediately.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13637-transhumanmarina","name":"TranshumanMarina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-07T18:25:57-08:00","id":1165989,"title":"","content":"For people asking for crossover with mortals, what kind of thing are you talking about that isn't in core books?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-07T19:46:34-08:00","id":1166004,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1165344-contagion-chronicle-wants?p=1165989#post1165989\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For people asking for crossover with mortals, what kind of thing are you talking about that isn't in core books?</div> </div> </div> </div>I cant speak for anyone else, but I do sort of assume Players's can choose Mortals in any of my games for Pc's (however ill advised that might be! heeh.), so what Im specifically wishing for is more that Contagion Chronicles Perhaps have a place for them, since the pitch seems more aimed at crossing over the various supernaturals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13637,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13637-transhumanmarina","user":"TranshumanMarina","date":". 12-07-2017, 11:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13637-transhumanmarina","name":"TranshumanMarina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-08T06:22:42-08:00","id":1166076,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1165344-contagion-chronicle-wants?p=1165989#post1165989\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For people asking for crossover with mortals, what kind of thing are you talking about that isn't in core books?</div> </div> </div> </div>Generally, adding regular mortals as PCs to games has inherent problems with basically all the gamelines, and I was thinking that the corebook could give us better ways to handle that sort of thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13001-sdespencer","name":"SdeSpencer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-08T07:09:40-08:00","id":1166087,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TranshumanMarina</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1165344-contagion-chronicle-wants?p=1165988#post1165988\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1.Crossover factions. A sort of psudosplat for the contagion chronicle specifically.. Thematically, perhaps Defined by how to deal with the Contagion?</div> </div> </div> </div>I like this.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 2.The above to include some traditional antagonists, as well. I mean, Having angels or Huntsmen might be a tough sell, but the otherwise 'evil protagonist' Style enemies could probably fill in for their more playable counterparts, as far as fighting the contagion goes. </div> </div> </div>Do you mean groups like the Pure, VII, and Banishers? Makes sense. Well, Banishers I could picture doubling down on their hatred of mages, assuming wiping the mages out will fix the Contagion, but the other two I could see easily - along with Centimani, and perhaps loyalists. Even some other species might work - maybe Sublimati or Azlu.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-09T16:49:15-08:00","id":1166359,"title":"","content":"<br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SunlessNick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1165344-contagion-chronicle-wants?p=1166087#post1166087\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like this.</div> </div> </div> </div></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Thanks! When I read the pitch for The Contagion Chronicles, and about how it would 'change how they see the world of darkness forever' Or whatever, My mind sort of went to all the ways such a setting shift could happen, and new factions and such was one idea.</span></span></span><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Do you mean groups like the Pure, VII, and Banishers? Makes sense. Well, Banishers I could picture doubling down on their hatred of mages, assuming wiping the mages out will fix the Contagion, but the other two I could see easily - along with Centimani, and perhaps loyalists. Even some other species might work - maybe Sublimati or Azlu.</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I was hesitant to name names, because Im not very familiar with 2E CoD yet, and I wasnt sure how many of those were even around, or if the fluff changed to make them less Viable. The Pure especially came to my mind, since originally they outnumber the Uratha by quite a bit, which might make them even more likely to fight the contagion. (assuming the Uratha havent already jumped in, though I wouldnt be against enemies working together on the short term, possibly to try and betray one another.) Though yeah, The others seem possible too, depending on circumstance. I will be really dissapointed if the Contagion Chronicle just sort of assumes they will all be infected/warped, and only traditional PC groups will be unaffected for some reason.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13637-transhumanmarina","name":"TranshumanMarina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-09T18:46:17-08:00","id":1166376,"title":"","content":"*cough* not trying to be mean but 1. Seers would probably be the better contrast to the Pentacle than Banishers and 2. Uratha is a term for all werewolves, including Pure, Forsaken (the word i believe you were looking for), and Other Werewolves that dont ally themselves with Luna or the Pure","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13001-sdespencer","name":"SdeSpencer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-09T19:37:57-08:00","id":1166385,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SdeSpencer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1165344-contagion-chronicle-wants?p=1166376#post1166376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*cough* not trying to be mean but 1. Seers would probably be the better contrast to the Pentacle than Banishers and 2. Uratha is a term for all werewolves, including Pure, Forsaken (the word i believe you were looking for), and Other Werewolves that dont ally themselves with Luna or the Pure</div> </div> </div> </div>My baad. Yeah, Forsaken. Its weird, I put Forsaken first, then I ended up editing it because I assumed I made some sort of mistake, but Low and behold my first instinct was correct. but yeah, Seers might make some sense, As they would be rather likely to not want some reality warping nonesense coming along and changing things under their feet, especially if the people they were teaming up with were other random supernaturals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13637-transhumanmarina","name":"TranshumanMarina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}